WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,450
There is no way to change this matter

2
00:00:03,450 --> 00:00:04,450
how to do

3
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:06,450
The best way is to make meritorious deeds

4
00:00:06,450 --> 00:00:08,450
When it comes to rewards for meritorious deeds

5
00:00:08,450 --> 00:00:10,450
Offer to be pardoned by His Majesty

6
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:13,450
But it seems you don’t still have the credit for this.

7
00:00:13,450 --> 00:00:15,580
Since it is the decree of the late emperor,

8
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:17,580
You'd better find out first

9
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:18,580
the reason for this

10
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:20,580
Make your decision again

11
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:22,960
Just leave

12
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:23,960
I am very busy

13
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:25,960
If the queen uses these trivial things again,

14
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:26,960
Escape from me

15
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:28,960
Don't blame me for only taking money

16
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:29,960
No more work

17
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:31,310
Then you say

18
00:00:31,310 --> 00:00:32,310
What's the big deal

19
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:34,310
This is a major political matter

20
00:00:34,310 --> 00:00:36,430
At least there is a direction

21
00:00:36,430 --> 00:00:40,800
Can the late emperor issue an edict

22
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:42,900
Peaceful and he will

23
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:47,660
Couldn't it be a rebellion? A rebellion?

24
00:00:47,660 --> 00:00:52,030
It shouldn't be such a simple punishment, right?

25
00:00:52,030 --> 00:00:53,030
Lu Guogong

26
00:00:53,030 --> 00:00:54,030
He must know
